# The suite's one SwiftFormat config. tools/lint/sync.sh copies it to every Swift repo as .swiftformat; edit it here only.
# CI runs `swiftformat --lint .`: whitespace and a few unambiguous fixes, nothing that reflows code.
--swiftversion 6.2
--exclude .build,build,References,DerivedData
--rules trailingSpace,linebreakAtEndOfFile,consecutiveBlankLines,duplicateImports,semicolons,spaceAroundParens,emptyBraces,todos
